file: macros/src/subject.rs
breaks: A variant whose one field is named and marked is rebuilt by its braces for a method returning `Self`, and under `Option<Self>` or `Result<Self, E>` its sentence names the tuple variant, as `docs/limits.md` and `docs/routes.md` say.
expect: killed

find:
        (Fields::Named(fields), [(Member::Named(name), field)]) if fields.named.len() == 1 => {
            (PayloadField::OnlyNamed(name.clone()), *field)
        }
replace:
        (Fields::Named(fields), [(Member::Named(name), field)]) if fields.named.len() == 1 => {
            (PayloadField::Beside(Member::Named(name.clone())), *field)
        }
